; Chapter01 close-character dappled-shadow look-dev: Epic only.
; Preserve lower scalability budgets and engine Cinematic settings.
[ShadowQuality@3]
r.Shadow.Virtual.SMRT.RayCountDirectional=12
r.Shadow.Virtual.SMRT.SamplesPerRayDirectional=8
; 2026-11-19 performance: sun (directional light) virtual shadow pages at the engine's High-tier resolution (Epic sets -1.5 = ~2.8x per axis).
; Measured on the uphill trail (RTX 4060 Laptop, editor PIE): ShadowDepths 25.5 -> 7.8 ms, frame 47.8 -> 30.5 ms.
; This lowers the sun's virtual-shadow-map resolution for EVERYTHING it shades, the character included (quality/perf trade-off).
; ResolutionLodBiasDirectionalMoving (-1.5) applies to a MOVING LIGHT, not to moving objects. Visual check: 2026-11-19 report.
; Backup: Saved/UE59Work/checkpoints/20261119_config/
r.Shadow.Virtual.ResolutionLodBiasDirectional=0.0
